Subject: Carry exact native GPU selectors through the public API
Why: AC-T7.4.1: preserve scheduler-selected physical identities through GuestSpec and process arguments using reviewed upstream API source36d9254, with typed validation and fallible selector storage; existing borrowed and compatibility patches remain intact.

